Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:33.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Todos sorriem para garotas bonitas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:34.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Meu Sonho!)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:37.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Só quero saber o que o futuro guarda{明日の扉の中を期待しちゃう}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.55,0:22:38.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Sozinha!)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:42.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Mesmo que as estrelas em um céu sem lua {もしも月のない空に星が}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:44.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}ainda brilhem{輝いても}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:45.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Sem magia!)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.89,0:22:49.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Mesmo que as nuvens em um céu sem sol
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:52.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}ainda sigam seu caminho{流れてても}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:54.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Eu continuo tristemente
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Que parecia que sempre ficaria ao meu lado){当たり前に隣にいた}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.69,0:22:58.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}a procurar por você{君を探してる}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:23:02.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Vou enquadrar uma foto de nós dois e pendurar{二人映るフレームデコレート}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.45,0:23:06.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Vou organizar tudo do meu jeito, como eu quiser, como realmente é{思うがままわがままありのままに並べよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:10.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Nossa sintonia: somar, subtrair, multiplicar, dividir por...{相性プラスマイナスマルチプライディバイドバイ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:10.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Eu amo tudo isso!{全部好き}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:14.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Me chamando, te chamando
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:15.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(E Você)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:17.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Quero subir as escadas do futuro com você{君と歩きたい未来ステアーズ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\i1}Lucky lucky shiny{\i0}, nossos corações vibrando em sonhos{Lucky lucky shiny, 二人のトキメキドリーミング}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:24.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Se amanhã o céu estiver limpo, vai ficar tudo bem{明日晴れなら何時もオーライ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:28.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Talvez eu esteja um pouco triste e fraco {ちょっとブルー ウィークネス}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:29.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Mas Feliz!){(But happy!)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Mas quando estou com você, me sinto salva{けど君がいるからfeel safe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:34.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Não existe tempo perdido{無駄な時間なんてない}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.10,0:23:36.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Vamos esperar a chuva passar{雨上がる空をwait until}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:39.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Olha para o céu! Se fizer isso{You look 見上げたら}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:42.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Coragem está em dois mundos, juntos agora
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:43.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Essa é a prova!)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}É isso que nos conecta{それが２つ結ぶ絆だから}
